---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 18,
  title: 'Day 18',
  date: '2026-09-23',
  description: 'eighteenth day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I was late 2min for a work transport, so I needed to get a free
          day,I get new haircut I will send images how I look, and how I should
          look like. I was also with my dad at a barbeque. After that we watched
          netflix series together, and I went to sleep. It was tired because I
          watched movie yesterday to about 4 a.m. but I count it like yesterday
          because, sleep is separator for me, when I count my days.Not the best
          day when I read that.
        </p>
      </section>
      How I should look:
      <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/day18/other.png`} />

      How I look:
      <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/day18/me.png`} />
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        It'll be my last day at work so, I want to finish Witcher that I
        started, I also want to start reading books before going to sleep, and
        I'll spend time with my family because it'll be also last day at home,
        and I'll go at training (so I don't have that much time work(5;45-18)
        training (20-22)) I don't think I can do much more
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 2/10, at least I got new haircut, and spend time with family
        </p>
        <DayRating class="w-full" rating={2} />
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
